// Store-Map (include/sea/Expr/StoreMap.hh, SeaMRules.hh; thesis Ch. 6, 7.2):
// the write rules of Fig. 6.4, the read rules of Fig. 6.5, the ordered map
// table, the expansion into stores, a random test of sound and normal memories,
// and the R-ABORT caching test (the Fig. 7.1 shape with store-maps: linear
// with chain-start caching, exponential without).
RUN: sea-store-map-test 12 | FileCheck %s
REQUIRES: yices
CHECK: test: smap-new-hit ok
CHECK: test: collapse ok
CHECK: test: commute ok
CHECK: test: barriers ok
CHECK: test: read ok
CHECK: test: table ok
CHECK: test: expand ok
CHECK: smap-shape abort-narrow variant=default N=40
CHECK: smap-ablation abort-narrow N=12
CHECK: test: abort-caching ok
CHECK: random: programs=12
CHECK: test: random ok
CHECK: failures: 0

